# TECH v0.3.1 QA HARNESS ONLY - NOT A PRODUCTION BASELINE.
# Assembled by ff6x/eventasm.py into QA_HARNESS (bank FF), target celes-qa only.
# Trigger: map $013 (Narshe, opening streets) tile (34,43).
#
#  - VANILLA_TILE_EVENT_LATCH ($1B5) is a vanilla READ-ONLY reference: SavePoint sets it,
#    the field engine clears it when the player moves. Checking it first stops the prompt
#    from re-opening every frame while the player stands on the tile after "No".
#  - "No" calls the unmodified vanilla SavePoint routine (CC:9AEB): blue flash, latch,
#    "save allowed" ($1BF) -> the normal main-menu Save works on this tile.
#  - "Yes" calls the unmodified v0.3 entry branch EvAnnexEnter_Yes (F1:000A):
#    same flags, same map $0C7, same arrival (16,27) as the Falcon entry.

@QaAccess
if_switch VANILLA_TILE_EVENT_LATCH=1 -> QaRet
dlg qa_prompt
choice QaYes, QaNo
@QaYes
call EvAnnexEnter_Yes
return
@QaNo
call VanillaSavePoint
@QaRet
return
